  "harness.note.claude-code": "Base URL reverse proxy (no Root CA required): updates env.ANTHROPIC_BASE_URL in ~/.claude/settings.json, chains any existing upstream gateway, and cleans up stale managed env overrides.",
  "harness.note.codex": "Base URL reverse proxy (no Root CA required): updates the active [model_providers.*].base_url (or top-level openai_base_url) in ~/.codex/config.toml and OPENAI_BASE_URL, chaining existing upstreams including local loopback gateways.",
  "harness.note.antigravity": "Enables reversible system proxy chaining (chaining any existing proxy and restoring it on disconnect or exit) plus Antigravity User/settings.json and terminal env vars, supporting live desensitization and restoration across gRPC/Protobuf and REST traffic; requires trusting the local Root CA.",
  "harness.note.zcode": "Sets ZCODE_HTTP_PROXY, ZCODE_NO_PROXY, ZCODE_AGENT_CA_CERT, HTTPS_PROXY, and NODE_EXTRA_CA_CERTS via ~/.hide-go/env.ps1 or your shell profile.",
  "harness.note.qoder": "Updates User/settings.json proxy settings for both Qoder and QoderCN along with terminal env vars, intercepting api1.qoder.sh and gateway.qoder.com.cn.",
  "harness.note.cursor": "Configures proxy settings in Cursor User/settings.json (including cursor.general.disableHttp2=true) and terminal env vars (HTTPS_PROXY / NODE_EXTRA_CA_CERTS).",
